{"taskId":"HC-901","attempt":2,"summary":"Normalize slugs with NFKC, lowercase text, expand ampersands to 'and', preserve Unicode letters and digits, and collapse separators into trimmed hyphens.","patches":[{"path":"src/hc-901.mjs","baseSha256":"0261B36AD203A96C73A38FD845B9A9CCF4D465D7B043394DF6C2170C16890A87","content":"export function toSlug(value) {
  return value
    .normalize('NFKC')
    .toLowerCase()
    .replace(/&/g, ' and ')
    .replace(/[^\p{L}\p{N}]+/gu, '-')
    .replace(/^-+|-+$/g, '');
}
"}],"limitations":["Unicode preservation follows prior review feedback despite the objective's ASCII-only wording.","Tests were not run because tool use and command execution were prohibited; passing evidence for test/hc-901.test.mjs in network-disabled Docker is unavailable."]}
